#: project/scenes/main/how_to_play.gd
msgid ""
"[b]Contracts and the hold[/b]\n"
"\n"
"• Accept contracts. Their freight goes to the dock.\n"
"• Drag a cargo into the hold, or click it and then click a cell.\n"
"• Right click or R rotates it. Green fits, red does not."
msgstr ""

#: project/scenes/main/how_to_play.gd
msgid ""
"[b]The warp[/b]\n"
"\n"
"• Each shift step slides all cargo to a wall or a stopped cargo.\n"
"• Force = weight × cells slid. Light {light}, standard {standard}, heavy {heavy}.\n"
"• Cargo at the front wall takes a jolt. Cargo that does not slide presses on the cargo in front of it. From leg 2, the last step is a fork."
msgstr ""

#: project/scenes/main/how_to_play.gd
msgid ""
"[b]Traits and reactions[/b]\n"
"\n"
"• Fragile breaks at force {fragile}. Broken cargo becomes scrap and stays.\n"
"• Volatile explodes at force {volatile} and breaks the cargo around it.\n"
"• Fluid leaks at force {fluid} and shorts the Electronic cargo next to it."
msgstr ""

#: project/scenes/main/how_to_play.gd
msgid ""
"[b]Links, the shop, and payments[/b]\n"
"\n"
"• Perishable needs a Cooler next to it. A Shield next to a Battery stops one reaction.\n"
"• Clamps stop a slide. Over the mass limit, the warp costs a fuel fee.\n"
"• Make the payment at the end of each leg, or the run ends."
msgstr ""

